ave is keen to hear about it and see a show in Boston.\n  - hard work: Dave felt bummed about a competing shop snagging a deal despite his effort. Calvin encouraged Dave not to give up, saying his hard work will be worth it.\n  - the sunlight: Dave commented that the sunlight hitting Calvin's item (a sign of hard work) is lovely and a great symbol of Calvin's dedication, making Calvin proud.\n  - mutual friend: Calvin's mutual friend arranged a meeting for Calvin with incredible artists in Boston for music collaboration.\n  - Dave: Dave enjoys photography, taking pictures of local scenery. He talked with Calvin about Calvin's inspiring chat with an artist at an event.\n  - faith and patience: Dave believes he needs to have faith and patience because he feels his efforts at work are going unseen, despite Calvin's encouragement.\n  - a great symbol of all your hard work: Calvin showed Dave a picture that Dave described as 'a great symbol of all your hard work', which reminds Calvin of how far he has come.\n  - strategies: Dave asked Calvin for strategies Calvin uses to manage everything, following Calvin mentioning feeling overwhelmed by demands while touring with Frank Ocean.\n  - efforts: Dave feels his work efforts are going unseen after a competing shop secured a deal he sought, but Calvin encouraged him not to give up.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1389,"context_chars":5749,"retrieval_duration":0.3333423137664795,"response_duration":3.060285806655884,"total_duration":3.3936281204223633,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer mentions both friends and team, which aligns with the gold answer, thus it is considered correct.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides sufficient information to answer the question about who supports Calvin in tough times. It explicitly mentions that Calvin's high school friend and his team are part of his strong support system, which aligns perfectly with the golden answer. Additiona