 of community and mutual support.\n\nThese methods collectively contribute to a more enriching and effective yoga experience for both Deborah and Jolene.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Deborah bought the candle to improve her yoga practice. (event_time: 2023-03-28T16:03:00Z)\n  - Deborah uses yoga to help find balance and inner peace. (event_time: 2023-08-21T09:11:00Z)\n  - Deborah participates in yoga and meditation with others. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Deborah recommends practicing mindful breathing for yoga. (event_time: 2023-06-06T15:56:00Z)\n  - Deborah offered Jolene help with her mindfulness workshops and reading. (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah finds instrumental tracks with mellow melodies and rhythms helpful for yoga practice (event_time: 2023-03-28T16:03:00Z)\n  - Deborah has a favorite yoga routine. (event_time: 2023-08-01T09:26:00Z)\n  - Deborah uses essential oils in her yoga practice (event_time: 2023-03-28T16:03:00Z)\n  - Jolene is trying to do more yoga to help relax and stay focused (event_time: 2023-08-21T09:11:00Z)\n  - Deborah uses the park as a peaceful spot to practice yoga (event_time: 2023-08-19T00:52:00Z)\n  - Deborah inquires whether Jolene does yoga with her partner. (event_time: 2023-02-25T16:50:00Z)\n  - Jolene and Deborah are partners in an activity. (event_time: 2023-07-09T19:37:00Z)\n  - Jolene uses yoga as a self-care activity to relax (event_time: 2023-09-08T19:39:00Z)\n  - The environment can enhance the practice, according to Deb